      "observed": "HSE1 connects to FCC1 pins 5 and 37, identified as PE6 and PE7, rather than the MCU's PH0/PH1 oscillator pins. HSE2 has no connection to NAVC1: its crystal network is separate, while NAVC1 pins 5 and 6 (PH0/PH1) connect to capacitor-only nets.",
      "expected": "Each 25 MHz HSE crystal network should connect to the corresponding MCU's HSE oscillator input and output pins, with the appropriate load network.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"31\") (name \"HSE_IN_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"PE6\")) ... (node (ref \"HSE1\") (pin \"1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"33\") (name \"HSE_OUT_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"37\") (pinfunction \"PE7\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"32\") (name \"HSE_IN_NAVC\") ... (node (ref \"HSE2\") (pin \"1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"90\") (name \"Net-(NAVC1-PH0)\") ... (node (ref \"NAVC1\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"PH0\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"91\") (name \"Net-(NAVC1-PH1)\") ... (node (ref \"NAVC1\") (pin \"6\") (pinfunction \"PH1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs) | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Neither MCU has the specified crystal correctly connected to its HSE oscillator pins, so the external clock source will not function as intended.",
      "confidence": 0.98
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The netlist shows fundamental connectivity faults: the MCU VDD pins are unconnected, the FCC VCAP pins are routed to UART3 connector signals, and the HSE crystal networks are not correctly connected to the MCU oscillator pins. These defects would prevent normal operation of the flight computers and their intended interfaces."
}

